# -- TINY PLANET
botania.entry.tinyPlanet=작은 행성
botania.tagline.tinyPlanet=주변으로 마나 폭발을 날려 보냅니다.
botania.page.tinyPlanet0=The &1Tiny Planet&0 is a &4Bauble&0 with gravitational proprieties, while equipped, the &1Tiny Planet&0 will pull any nearby &4Mana Bursts&0 towards the wearer, having them orbit around him or her.<br>By increasing its mass with some &1Stone&0, it can also be placed in world, for the same effect.
